the realm  do you know what the realm is  it's the thousand blades of aegon's  enemies  a story we agreed to tell each other  over  and over till we forget that it's a lie  what's up ladies and gentlemen welcome  back for another game of thrones and a  song of ice and fire update video well  my friends it looks like we have another  incredible update from the man the myth  and the legend himself mr george r  martin now in this new update he reveals  some new shocking information about how  he will end a song of ice and fire as a  matter of fact he finally admitted to  something i had known all along  let's go over to his not a blog website  once again so you can see exactly what i  mean the name of this new update is a  winter garden george rr martin says i've  done a lot of interviews over the years  more than i can even keep track of  inevitably a lot of them are on the same  subjects  one of the things i have been asked  about most is how i write my novels now  if you've seen any of those interviews  you have most likely heard me talking  about the two types of writers the  architects and the gardeners i have  given the same spiel numerous times now  another question that i get a lot  especially since the end of game of  thrones on hbo is whether a song of ice  and fire will end the same way an  architect would be able to give a short  concise simple answer to that but as you  all know i'm much more of a gardener my  stories grow and evolve and change as i  write them i generally know where i'm  going sure the final destinations the  big set pieces they've been in my head  for years for decades in the case of a  song of ice and fire there are lots of  devils in the details though and  sometimes the ground changes under my  feet as the words move forth another  question fans and interviewers alike ask  a lot is where do you get your ideas  honestly i wish i knew when confronted  with the same question harlan ellison  used to say schenectady the ancient  greeks spoke of the muses  freud talked to the conscious and  subconscious minds the id the ego the  superego now more recently we hear about  the right brain and the left brain one  analytic and rational the other  imaginative and creative i'm sure the  answer is not schenectady but aside from  that hell i don't know yes now there are  some instances where i know the seed  from which something in my garden sprang  the wall sprang from my visit to  hadrian's wall in 1981. the war of the  roses inspired much of game of thrones  and the red wedding was a mashup of the  glencoe massacre and the black dinner  from scottish history but for every  instance like that there are a hundred  for which i have to say i don't know  one day the thought just came to me it  wasn't there and then it was now this is  what brings him to the winds of winter  most of you know by now that i do not  like to give detailed updates on the  winds of winter i'm working on it i have  been working on it and i will continue  to work on it yes i do work on other  things as well i love nothing more than  to surprise my readers with twists and  turns they did not see coming and i risk  losing those moments if i go into too  much detail even saying that i'm working  on a tyrian chapter as i did last week  gives away the fact that tyrion is not  dead reading sample chapters at  conventions or uploading them online  which i did for years gives away even  more i actually quite enjoyed doing that  until the day came that i realized i had  read or shared the first couple hundred  pages from the winds of winter or  thereabouts if i'd kept on with the  readings half of the book might already  be out by now so i'm not going to give  all of you any kind of detailed report  on the novel but i will say this i have  been at work in my winter garden things  are growing and changing as does happen  with us gardeners things twist things  change new ideas come to me old ideas  prove unworkable and i write i rewrite i  restructure i rip everything out and  rewrite again i go through doors that  lead nowhere in doors that open up on  marvel's it sounds mad i know but it's  how i write always has been always will  be for good or for the ill alright folks  now this is where things get very  interesting he says what i've noticed  more and more of late however is my  gardening is taking me further and  further away from the television show  yes some of the things you saw on hbo in  a game of thrones you will also see in  the winds of winter though maybe not in  quite the same ways however much of the  rest will be quite different and really  when you think about it this was  inevitable the novels are much bigger  and much much much more complex than the  show certain things that happened on hbo  will not happen in the novels i have  viewpoint characters in the books never  seen on the show victarion greyjoy  ariane martell aria hota john connington  and aaron damper they will all have  chapters and the things they do and say  will impact the story and the major  characters who were on the show i have  legions of secondary characters not povs  but nonetheless important to the main  plot who will also figure in the story  lady stoneheart young griff the tattered  prince penny brown ben plum the shave  pate marwinda mage darkstar and jane  westerling some characters you saw on  the show are very different than the  versions in the novels yara greyjoy is  not asha greyjoy and hbo's geron greyjoy  is way way way way different from mine  yeah i think some of us did notice quay  still has her own part to play and so  does rickon stark and even jane pull  and well the list is very long and all  of this is why the winds of winter has  taken so long this is hard guys  oh and there will be new characters as  well  no new viewpoints i swear on that but  with all these journeys and battles and  scheming to come inevitably our major  characters will be encountering new ones  in lands far and near one thing i can  say in general enough terms that i will  not be spoiling anything not all of the  characters who survived until the end of  a game of thrones will survive until the  end of a song of ice and fire and not  all of the characters who died on game  of thrones will die in a song of ice and  fire now i do wonder might this be a  reference to daenerys targaryen someone  that a lot of the fans were upset with  when she died in the show  george rr martin finishes by saying some  will sure of course maybe most but  definitely not all now of course i could  change my mind again next week with the  next chapter that i write that's how  gardening works in the ending you will  need to wait until i get there  some things will be the same a lot will  not  no doubt once i'm done there will be a  big debate about which version of the  story is better now if i'm being honest  george i think most fans have already  decided  some will like my book others will like  the television show and that's fine now  i do fear that a certain section of the  fans are so angry about how long the  winds of winter has taken me that  they're ready to hate the book even  without reading it that saddens me but  there's nothing i can do about that all  i can do is write the best book that i  can and hope that when it's released  most fans will read it with a clean  hands and open mind that's all i can  tell you right now i need to get back to  my garden lord tyrion is waiting for me  well there you have it ladies and  gentlemen you've now heard it once again  from the man himself the ending of a  song of ice and fire will not be the  same as the ending of a game of thrones  now he's also said that no matter how  the fans react he would not make any  changes to his story but with that being  said i still wonder if the reaction to  the ending of a game of thrones affected  him or his writing in any way i imagine  that it must have in some way but i  guess we'll never know for sure unless  he comes out and says so himself  let me know what all of you think about  this new update if i'm being honest i've  known this all along i've even said it  in numerous videos but it's always nice  to hear it from the author himself if we  ever do get the real ending to a song of  ice and fire it will not look the same  as the ending from the television show  unfortunately none of this will really  matter unless he actually releases the  damn novel we can never debate about  which is better if we never get his  version  as of right now the only ending we have  is what hbo has given us  or i should say what dan and dave has  given us i think i can speak for most  fans when i say george we are begging  you for your real ending  now get your ass back to that garden  as always i want to thank everyone for  watching this video leave me your  thoughts on all of this down below  have a great day everyone i will see you  soon in the next video  bye  [Music]  so  so  you

